<title>SOUTH KOREA: Bank of Korea said to step into forex market again.</title>
<headline>Bank of Korea said to step into forex market again.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Korea intervened again in the interbank market in mid-afternoon trading on Monday to slow the won's decline against the U.S. dollar, dealers said.</p>
<p>The central bank denied it had intervened.</p>
</text>
